  "merger_description": "Monadelphous Group Limited (**Monadelphous**)\u00a0proposes to acquire 100% of the issued share capital in Tyden Power Pty Ltd (**Tyden Power**) (the **Acquisition**).\n\nMonadelphous is an ASX-listed Australian engineering group providing construction, maintenance and industrial services to the resources, energy and infrastructure sectors. Monadelphous, through its various business units, provides high voltage (**HV**) electrical services principally in Western Australia, Victoria and Queensland.\n\nTyden Power is a New South Wales-based provider of HV engineering, testing, commissioning, maintenance and construction services to customers in the energy, utilities and infrastructure sectors.\n\nFollowing completion, Tyden Power will become a wholly-owned subsidiary of Monadelphous.",
